    5040: 5 steps -> 5040 -> 5355 -> 1998 -> 8082 -> 8532 -> 6174

  7641 / 1467 = 849/163 = 5.208589
  Compare to golden ratio phi = 1.618034
  Ratio / phi = 3.219085

  Digit pair differences:
  max pair: 7-1 = 6 = 2*3 (geometric base)
  mid pair: 6-4 = 2 (doubler)
  OR: 7-4 = 3 (curver), 6-1 = 5 (GOLDEN!)

  The digits 6174, split as (6,1) and (7,4):
  6-1 = 5 = GOLDEN PRIME
  7-4 = 3 = RAMIFIED PRIME
  Product of differences: 5*3 = 15 = max H at n=5!

