  IX. THE GRAND SYNTHESIS
  --------------------------------------------------

  6174 = 2^1 * 3^2 * 7^3 is a TRIPLE RESONANCE:

  LAYER 1 — THE TRIPLE OF TRIPLES (3x3 matrix):
    Column 0 product = 42 (Hurwitz constant)
    Column 1 product = 6 (geometric base)
    Column 2 product = 6174 (Kaprekar fixed point)

  LAYER 2 — THE TETRAHEDRON (4 digits as 4 vertices):
    Face {1,6,7} product = 42 = HURWITZ CONSTANT
    Face {4,6,7} product = 168 = |PSL(2,7)| = KLEIN QUARTIC
    All 4 digits product = 168 = Klein quartic group order

  LAYER 3 — THE PENTAGON (5 in the structure):
    Digit difference 6-1 = 5 = GOLDEN PRIME
    Digit difference 7-4 = 3 = RAMIFIED PRIME
    5 * 3 = 15 = max H at n=5 = {GOLDEN}*{RAMIFIED}
    Kaprekar = 999*6 + 90*2 in (p,q) space
    p=6 = {2,3} base, q=2 = DOUBLER

  The fixed point 6174 ENCODES the entire project:
    Its prime factorization gives the Hurwitz primes {2,3,7}
    Its digit product gives the Klein quartic 168
    Its digit differences give the primes {3,5}
    Its (p,q) coordinates give the geometric base {2,3}
    Its 3x3 matrix column products give {42, 6, 6174}

  6174 is the CRYSTALLIZATION of {2,3,5,7} into a single number.
  The Kaprekar iteration is the CONVERGENCE process that
  finds this crystallized form from arbitrary initial conditions.

